If $f$ is convex and $\bar{x}_{K}:=\frac{1}{K}\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}x_{k}$, then
\[
f(\bar{x}_{K})-f(x^{\star})\le\frac{1}{K}\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\bigl(f(x_{k})-f(x^{\star})\bigr).
